'''Kenshin Himura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]] increases damage and backswing duration, lengthens attack frequency, shortens foreswing, and grants [[Long Distance]] and [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]].

